# Burn Together (CR 608.2b, official ruling): Bot2 bolts its own Elvish Spirit Guide in response, so the other target is illegal while the first is still
# legal. The spell resolves: no damage is dealt (there is nothing to deal it to), but the Simian Spirit Guide is still sacrificed, and the Adventure card
# is exiled because it resolved.

